],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 188% of normal in May to June, then 52% in August to September and 50% in November to December. Grid 16368 had its driest year in 2007, at 56% of normal.</p>"}
